  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whomper.png\" title=\"[GG] Whomper\"><img alt=\"[GG] Whomper\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"286\" src=\"/images/recovered/Whomper.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Whomper.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>[GG] Whomper</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b>Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Fighter\n</p><p>Whompers are created to bash!  Armed with a huge pneumatic hammer they stand still and just pound.  They are sometimes found in company with types of ranged fades to make up a difficult group to fight.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GG] Whomper\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Haxhaxor Libratorium</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
